@* In a Blazor app, the body of the NotFound page: <KlyError StatusCode="404" />. HeadingLevel="3" only keeps this page's outline in order. *@
<div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-(--klyroo-border)">
    <KlyError StatusCode="404" HeadingLevel="3" data-testid="error" />
</div>
